msgid "The interface fonts are Inter, Source Sans 3 and JetBrains Mono (SIL Open Font License 1.1). Every icon is drawn in code and is original work. No artwork, fonts or text from other mail programs are included."
msgstr "As fontes da interface são Inter, Source Sans 3 e JetBrains Mono (licença SIL Open Font License 1.1). Os ícones são desenhados em código."

msgid "Messages are shown without running anything in them, and the pictures a message keeps on the web are downloaded only when you ask. Passwords are kept in memory only while the app is open."
