msgid "Everything the interface does is a command: {commands} of them, covering {percent}% of the feature catalog. The command line, the control channel and the MCP server run the same commands."
msgstr "A interface oferece {commands} comandos, correspondentes a {percent}% do catálogo de recursos. Linha de comando, canal de controle e servidor MCP usam os mesmos comandos."

